    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24251" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερ-οδέομαι</span></b>  (better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερ-ῳδέομαι</span></b> ), 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be secondary,
				produced by repetition,</i> of numbers, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονάδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Ar.</u>
					1.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				149.23
			</span></i>:—hence Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερ-οδία</span></b>  (better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερ-ῳδία</span></b> ), ἡ, <i>secondary series,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theol.Ar.
				34
			</span></i>.</div>
